    <SectionTitle as="h1" size="large" tone="dark">Cutting Edge Experience</SectionTitle>
    <p class="hero__description">Orders fill fast, pricing stays predictable, and your assets stay locked down. The result is simple: more executed trades, fewer surprises.</p>
